  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{自制心|じせいしん}→自制心：18252_jiseishin⟧: self-control, willpower\n- {自制|じせい}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{失|うしな}う→失う：01887_ushinau⟧: to lose self-control\n- {自制|じせい}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{利|き}かない→利く：11845_kiku⟧: to be unable to control oneself\n- {自制|じせい}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{促|うなが}す→促す：10875_unagasu⟧: to urge restraint\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{我慢|がまん}→我慢：00057_gaman⟧: putting up with something — the everyday word for holding back\n- ⟦{抑制|よくせい}→抑制：05635_yokusei⟧: restraint, suppression — also of external things such as prices or a reaction\n- ⟦{節制|せっせい}→節制：16729_sessei⟧: moderation — in eating, drinking, or habits\n- ⟦{自粛|じしゅく}→自粛：07650_jishuku⟧: voluntary restraint — refraining from an activity out of consideration for others",
